  "title": "Textron Systems Collaborates with Kodiak to Develop Uncrewed Military Vehicle",
  "summary": "Kodiak AI and Textron Systems are collaborating to develop an autonomous military ground vehicle specifically designed for driverless operations. Through this collaboration, Kodiak will integrate its industry-leading autonomous system, the Kodiak Driver, into a Textron Systems prototype, purpose-built uncrewed military vehicle.",
